# Pangle ships PAGAdSDK as a fat static library: 168 MB for the simulator
# slice (arm64 + x86_64) and 82 MB for the device slice. The simulator one
# is over GitHub's hard 100 MB file limit, so both binaries are stored in
# Git LFS and the repository keeps only ~130-byte pointers.
#
# The pattern matches the Mach-O binaries themselves - the files named
# PAGAdSDK inside each PAGAdSDK.framework - not PAGAdSDK.framework,
# PAGAdSDK.bundle or the headers, which are small and diff usefully.
#
# Anyone cloning needs git-lfs installed (`brew install git-lfs`,
# `git lfs install`) or those two files arrive as pointer text and the
# build fails to link.
CoreBundle/PangleSDK-8.2.1.0/PAGAdSDK.xcframework/**/PAGAdSDK filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
